full-query: "You are a site reliable engineer in a company. Your company has a new application deployed in AWS that has three tiers including frontend, backend and database. Various AWS services are being used such as EC2, ELB, Auto Scaling, Route53, RDS, etc. For the whole application, the RTO (recovery time objective) is set to 1 hour. Which approach can help you the most to achieve this target?"
